        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paradyce is a story-driven strategy game about love, loss, and survival.<br>With limited resources and few allies, YOU must protect Cynthia against the endless armies of the Orthodoxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only a handful of tiles to place, every decision matters.<br>Each part of the game challenges YOU to think strategically rather than rely on endless options. A single misplaced tile, or a forest that grows slightly too far east, can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your fields and forests are mismanaged, YOU will fail.<br>Two swordsmen and their dogs can quickly grow into a vast army, united by one goal: to kill Cynthia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your small 5x5 world can expand as the Orthodoxy is pushed back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is inevitable. Surrender is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“For YOU and I, there never was, and never will be… Paradise.”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⦁ Rediscover love<br>⦁ Fight the Orthodoxy<br>⦁ Piece together a story YOU once forgot <br>⦁ Build strategically<br>⦁ Manage scarce resources<br>⦁ Tend crops and harvest forests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023550/extras/b9b42b8e2eb9ab6c1989dd5d2c51a892.avif?t=1762730007\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p>",
